Door and civilian-group oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE
(SFI-SCLA). Appends a wrapper around the static DoTrapCheckOnStartingMenu of Handle_Doors.cc, so the door probes can run
the start-of-menu trap check without opening the door menu, and an accessor for the static hostile-quote list of
OppList.cc. No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0010.

